  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(219 fotos) Sim&oacute;n C.P., vecino de Onda y de&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">69 a&ntilde;os de edad, ha resultado herido leve la tarde de este domingo en el primero de los dos &#39;bous en corda&#39; en el barrio del Tossalet, en las confluencias de la calle de este nombre con Juan Ram&oacute;n Jim&eacute;nez y San Bartolom&eacute;. </span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5247.jpg\" alt=\"img_5247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5248.jpg\" alt=\"img_5248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5250.jpg\" alt=\"img_5250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5251.jpg\" alt=\"img_5251\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5252.jpg\" alt=\"img_5252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5253.jpg\" alt=\"img_5253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5254.jpg\" alt=\"img_5254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouencordatossalet17/img_5255.jpg\" alt=\"img_5255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouen